function numsIn(line){const re=/-?\s?R?\$?\s?-?(?:\d{1,3}(?:\.\d{3})+|\d+)(?:,\d+)?%?/g;return (line.match(re)||[]).map(parseBR).filter(n=>n!=null)}
function splitLabel(l){const m=l.match(/^(.*?)(?=\t|\s+-?\s?R\$|\s+-?\d)/);if(!m)return [l,''];return [m[1].trim(),l.slice(m[0].length)]}
function parseDRE(text,defs,target){
 const lines=text.split(/\r?\n/).map(l=>l.trim()).filter(Boolean);let found=0;const miss=[];
 defs.forEach((d,i)=>{if(d.auto)return;const keys=[d.k].concat(d.al||[]).map(norm);
  let rest=null;
  for(const l of lines){const [lab,r]=splitLabel(l);const nl=norm(lab);if(nl&&keys.some(k=>nl===k||nl.startsWith(k))){rest=r;break}}
  if(rest==null){miss.push(d.k);return}
  const n=numsIn(rest);
  if(n.length<2){miss.push(d.k);return}
  const r=target[i];r.orc=n[0];r.real=n[1];r.ant=n.length>=7?n[4]:(n.length>=5?n[4]:(n[2]??r.ant));found++});
 return {found,total:defs.filter(d=>!d.auto).length,miss}}
function parseCS(text){const out=[];text.split(/\r?\n/).forEach(l=>{l=l.trim();if(!l)return;const m=l.match(/^([^\d\t]+?)\s*(?:\t|\s{2,}|\s(?=\d))/);if(!m)return;const h=m[1].trim();if(/hotel|pool|ocupa/i.test(h))return;const n=numsIn(l.slice(m[0].length));if(n.length<4)return;out.push({h,pool:n[0],occ:n[1],adr:n[2],rev:n[3]})});return out}

